   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COD034N DRC JR 2022-23</narrative>
  </title>
  <description promeva:title="Description (English)" promeva:type="104" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The DRCJR 2022-2023 is planned to take place in five health zones in North &amp; South Kivu. Both provinces have been marked by violent conflict, leading to displacement, food insecurity, malnutrition, epidemics, and protection problems. CARE focusses on South Kivu with work on Livelihoods, WASH and Protection.</narrative>
  </description>
